000001 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000002 PROGRAM-ID. PKASIGN.
000003* Synthetic program for crypto algorithm reading (Week 7).
000004 DATA DIVISION.
000005 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000006 01  WS-RC                   PIC S9(8) COMP.
000007 01  WS-REASON               PIC S9(8) COMP.
000008 01  WS-RULE-COUNT           PIC S9(8) COMP VALUE 1.
000009 01  WS-KEY-RULES.
000010     05  WS-KEY-TYPE         PIC X(8) VALUE 'RSA-PRIV'.
000011 01  WS-KEY-VALUES.
000012     05  WS-MODULUS-BITS     PIC 9(4) COMP VALUE 2048.
000013     05  WS-EXPONENT-LEN     PIC 9(4) COMP VALUE 3.
000014 01  WS-SIGN-RULES           PIC X(8).
