000019 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
000020 MAIN-PARA.
000021     CALL 'CSNDPKB' USING WS-RC WS-REASON WS-RULE-COUNT
000022          WS-KEY-RULES WS-KEY-VALUES WS-KEY-TOKEN
